<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Bobl 119/120 series.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Bobl 119/120 series.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) has issued 100 million American-style call and put warrants, in 10 equal tranches, on the Bobl 119 and 120 series, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>There are four tranches on the 5.0 percent Bobl series 119, due September 1997 and six tranches on the 5.0 percent Bobl series 120 due December 1997.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   06.JAN.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> SERIES 119	   STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p>EXPIRES 15.SEP.97</p>
<p>    CALL		103.0 PCT   0.30 DEM   1.50 PCT  67.8 X</p>
<p>    CALL		104.0 PCT   0.14 DEM   2.30 PCT  79.9 X</p>
<p>    PUT		 102.0 PCT   2.37 DEM   2.10 PCT  30.9 X</p>
<p>    PUT		 103.0 PCT   3.16 DEM   1.90 PCT  26.1 X</p>
<p>SERIES 120</p>
<p>EXPIRES  15.DEC.97</p>
<p>    CALL		101.0 PCT   1.20 DEM   0.40 PCT  47.5 X</p>
<p>    CALL		102.0 PCT   0.75 DEM   0.90 PCT  51.6 X</p>
<p>    CALL		103.0 PCT   0.43 DEM   1.60 PCT  56.8 X</p>
<p>    PUT		 100.0 PCT   1.33 DEM   3.10 PCT  36.0 X</p>
<p>    PUT		 101.0 PCT   1.86 DEM   2.60 PCT  31.7 X</p>
<p>    PUT		 100.0 PCT   2.50 DEM   2.30 PCT  28.1 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
